      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Suggesting that coherent human intent influences HFT models requires implying that your internal state generates a distinct, quantifiable signal detectable by machine learning models, which is beyond current established science. While advanced ML models can be trained to recognize complex human-driven trading patterns, interpreting mere focus as a directive signal is a significant leap. It is more plausible that your heightened focus allows you to better perceive natural, complex market correlations that are otherwise lost in the noise.",
